WEBVTT

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.250
After Colony 195.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:14.780
The final war between Earth and
the Space Colonies had ended…

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:19.560
…eliminating boundaries
between nations.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:23.580
The colonies and Earth
choose to coexist…

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.780
…thus giving rise to the
Earth Sphere Unified Nation…

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:30.380
…and the hope for
everlasting peace.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:34.980
And now, the year
After Colony 196.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.920
No military weapons remain
in the Earth Sphere.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.760
However, as long as
mankind exists…

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.840
…there will always be battles.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.380
This is Water.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.110
I’ve confirmed our target.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.070
I’ve locked on.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.240
Neo-titanium?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.240
How did this get here?

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:28.220
As long as peace continues,
there’s no need for Gundams.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.020
It’s tough parting with them.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.930
No, it’s okay.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.730
Let’s hurry and send them
into the sun…

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:37.630
…with this disposal block.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.850
Right.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.630
Goodbye, my Sandrock.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.850
See ya later, old pal.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:12.520
Wufei didn’t bring
his after all.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:13.650
No, he didn’t.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:17.360
Heero and Trowa sent their
Gundams to me right away.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.140
I wonder how everyone’s doing.

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:29.870
Silent Orbit

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:37.750
At the natural resources
satellite MO-II…

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.010
…a ceremony was being held…

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.720
…to mark the first anniversary
of the war’s end.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.470
One year ago…

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.800
…people didn’t have the peace
of mind to enjoy Christmas.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.770
Things have sure changed.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:54.230
We are here to remember
the many lives lost…

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.500
…as a result of a foolish war.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.180
However, those lives were
not lost in vain.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.950
That’s because the many
departed souls…

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:09.310
…left us with valuable lessons
and tools for reflection.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:14.160
So finally, we’ve been
able to attain peace.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.660
The president doesn’t get it.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:24.220
It’s harder to maintain peace
than it is to attain it.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.640
He understands that.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.430
Otherwise, the government…

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.810
…wouldn’t financially back
us Preventers.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:34.550
He’s pretty smart for a person
elected democratically.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.770
Sure you can miss the
rest of the ceremony?

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.650
Preventers only put
out fires.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.110
These ceremonies don’t suit us.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:44.740
So?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.320
There’s a possibility that
the Neo-titanium…

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.740
…is from the thirteenth
constellation.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.020
You mean it’s a new
mobile suit model?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.750
I’m using various sources…

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.040
…to determine where it’s from.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.460
We’ve gotta put out this fire
while it’s still small.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.510
This isn’t going to
be quite as simple…

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.300
…as our last few missions.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.880
I agree.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.190
As you’re aware…

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.270
…it’s been only seven years…

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:25.740
…since Colony L3 X-18999
was completed.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.200
We’ve invited people from Earth
to come live here…

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.700
…but our unstable economy…

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.940
…is preventing the population
from growing.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.250
The problem is whether
the citizens understand…

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.380
…that they’re members of the
Earth Sphere Unified Nation.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.960
One can’t expect a stable
lifestyle…

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.630
…if one’s own colony alone
is prospering.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:49.300
But we’ve been told
that many citizens here…

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.720
…hope for a strong leader
to rise up and guide them.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.920
Someone like yourself,
Vice Foreign Minister Darlian.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.040
That’s a shame.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:08.140
Finally, true peace and
freedom has been attained…

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:09.950
…and yet…

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.920
Be gentle with her.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.620
Understood, sir.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.360
Our scheme is complete now.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.130
That’s right.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:34.010
Those lacking leadership
should make way…

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.790
…for those possessing it.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.970
<i>It is our sincere wish that
peace will last forever.</i>

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.730
Nothing wrong with
wishing for peace.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:49.700
The real question is whether
mankind is ready for it.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:53.740
We’ll just have to teach
them how to deal with it.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:54.950
Right, Dekim?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:58.160
Correct, Miss Mariemaia.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.620
My father entrusted me with
these Christmas presents.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.130
I must deliver them to
the people.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.710
I can’t believe how small
the crowd is today.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:24.180
It looks like this colony has
other forms of entertainment.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.110
Other forms of entertainment?

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.400
What do you mean?

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.480
I’m gonna check it out.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.480
Trowa?

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.070
Trowa…

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.400
The Barton Foundation?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.640
I guess he hasn’t given up yet.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.250
Or maybe it’s Leia’s daughter.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.100
I think her name was Mariemaia.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.350
Hey, No-Name…

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.910
I’ll show you something
I’ve never shown anyone.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.930
Her name is Mariemaia;
she’s my sister’s daughter.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:27.830
She’ll be Earth’s leader
after we conquer it.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.790
Mariemaia Barton.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.860
Born in After Colony 189.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.110
Mother, Lisa Barton.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.980
Deceased two years
after her birth.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:52.440
Father, unknown.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:54.580
It’s Christmas.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:57.060
But someone always
gets stuck working.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.660
Didn’t know Trowa had a niece.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.160
So the records say.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:05.460
But the Trowa we know
isn’t the real Trowa Barton.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.460
Right, I almost forgot.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.290
You going?

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.450
Yeah.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.460
Relena’s been kidnapped.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.600
Anything for the one you love.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.600
Comrades.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:26.690
The time has come to stand up
for Miss Mariemaia.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.440
We thank you all
for your efforts…

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.690
…to tolerate the
intolerable…

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.110
…and bear the unbearable
over this past year.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:37.610
Today you are starting
on the road to glory!

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:40.410
The awakening of a new
humanity…

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.410
…will be triggered by
the soldiers of Mariemaia…

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.790
…and we shall be the symbol
of hope for the people.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.910
But first…

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.950
…we must eliminate
all threatening elements.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.750
Trowa Barton, to the front!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.590
Hold it.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:08.690
Wufei.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.610
This is Water.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.560
Respond on secret lines D to R.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.780
This is Fire.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.830
Line is secured; go ahead.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.620
I found out where
the fire started.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.410
Is it L3?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.500
Your instincts still amaze me.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:34.310
It wasn’t hard to figure out,
considering the areas searched.

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:36.760
Did you determine which
colony it is?

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:40.340
The new colony, X-18999.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.140
Who’s the leader?

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.600
Mariemaia Barton.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.710
Barton?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.100
As I feared, we’re too late.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.810
I expect they’ll declare
independence or war…

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.900
…against Earth within
a few hours.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:57.150
And the bad news
doesn’t end there.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.150
What else?

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.860
Vice Foreign Minister Darlian
has been missing…

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:03.280
…since her last official
visit to X-18999.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.940
Relena?!

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.740
I think we’d better hurry.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.950
Roger.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.620
We’ll change our rendezvous
point.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.760
So, you’re awake.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.590
Who are you?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.860
Have you been kidnapped too?

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:37.730
No.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.610
I’m the one that ordered
you brought here.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.360
What are you talking about?

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.270
My name is Mariemaia Khushrenada.

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.700
Daughter of Treize Khushrenada.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.370
You’re joking.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.710
It’s no joke.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.250
It’s been proven through
DNA testing.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:56.170
But that’s…

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:59.210
I hear there’s a so-called
adult world…

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.380
…that kids don’t understand.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.340
So I can’t begin to explain…

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.550
…how I’ve come to live
in this world.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:08.110
But the facts are the facts.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.970
And I intend to carry
out my father’s wishes.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:14.140
I don’t know who’s been
telling you these stories.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.560
But you’re mistaken.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.810
Enough!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.520
That’s enough.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:22.110
I’ve been chosen to lead
the Earth Sphere Unified Nation.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.440
I won’t allow such rude talk!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.780
It’s nothing.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:30.660
Leave the room.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.150
Ma’am!

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.000
This room is under surveillance.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.960
So don’t try anything funny.

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:46.300
I am meeting you like this
out of respect…

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:49.300
…for the fact that you
were once Queen Relena.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.770
Be more careful in the future.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:53.600
Let me ask you this.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.620
What do you plan to do
with me now?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.680
You’ll find out soon enough.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.010
We went to all that trouble
just to obtain peace.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.030
Now someone’s gotta help
maintain it, right?

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.530
Heero?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.290
If you wanted to sleep,
why didn’t you say so?

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.100
<i>Are you lost?</i>

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.510
<i>I said, are you lost?</i>

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.700
<i>I’ve been lost ever since
I was born.</i>

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.890
<i>Oh, that’s so sad.</i>

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.210
<i>Well, I’m not lost.</i>

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.530
<i>I’m taking Mary out for a walk.</i>

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.950
<i>Here.</i>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.380
<i>I’ll give you this flower.</i>

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.850
<i>Wait for me, Mary!</i>

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.600
<i>Mary!</i>

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.080
<i>Mission complete.</i>

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.320
<i>That’s ludicrous!</i>

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:56.820
<i>You mean use the Gundam
as a tool of carnage?!</i>

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.910
<i>This is a war!</i>

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.540
<i>Sacrificing the general
public is of no relevance.</i>

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.580
<i>Got it?</i>

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.960
<i>Now retrain him at once!</i>

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>Our weapon has no use
for human kindness!</i>

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.900
<i>You’re right.</i>

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.510
<i>But do you really believe…</i>

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:18.680
<i>…Heero Yuy would be pleased
if we obliterated mankind?</i>

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.190
<i>Heero! Hey, Heero!</i>

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.890
Wake up!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.060
What is it?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:30.730
The little girl is about to
issue a statement.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:35.490
<i>We, at Colony L3 X-18999
hereby wish to announce…</i>

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:39.620
<i>…our independence from the
Earth Sphere Unified Nation…</i>

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.580
<i>…and declare war!</i>

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:45.620
<i>I am a legitimate heir
of the World Nation Sovereign.</i>

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:49.120
<i>My name is Mariemaia Khushrenada…</i>

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.710
<i>…daughter of Treize Khushrenada.</i>

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.710
What?!

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:54.130
Treize’s daughter?!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.760
<i>I’m carrying out my
father’s will.</i>

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:00.760
<i>It’s in human nature to fight!</i>

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.350
How could this happen?!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.900
Why couldn’t you have
prevented this?!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.810
I reported this matter
the other day.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.520
<i>I know that!</i>

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.590
<i>But your department
receives sufficient funds…</i>

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:16.890
<i>…to prevent these situations!</i>

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.320
I understand that.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:21.620
We’re doing everything to
stop this from progressing.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.830
But it seems they’d
prepared for this…

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:28.450
…even before our department
was ever formed.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.340
I can stand here and
make excuses all day.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:37.870
But the question remains…

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.420
…whether or not we can stop
their aggression without help.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.390
Who’re you?

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:44.940
Excuse me.

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:45.730
You’re…

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:49.020
I’ve come to ask for
a code name.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.400
I’d like the name Wind…

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:54.390
…appropriate for one who
puts out fires.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.860
We’re almost in the L3 Area.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:02.160
So how do you suggest
we get in?

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.790
We could take over
a couple mobile suits.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.910
But we’d probably be
targeted while boarding.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.800
Then we’ll have to fly
straight through.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.540
It’s the only way.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:13.900
Man!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.510
How about using your head?

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:17.470
You too.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.790
What?!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.470
Unidentified shuttle ahead!

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:22.970
It’s flying into the
troop of mobile suits!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.240
Attention, approaching shuttle!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:26.930
This is a danger zone!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:27.680
Retreat!

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.440
<i>Yo! Long time no see!</i>

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:30.740
Duo…

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.150
And Heero?!

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:35.320
<i>Seems they’re gonna have
quite a Christmas party.</i>

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.690
<i>Thought we’d give them
a little present.</i>

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:40.070
Not without your Gundams!

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.660
You have no way to retaliate!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.740
<i>I’m sure we’ll think
of something.</i>

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:46.410
<i>That’s if we can get
to the colony.</i>

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.870
Duo, Heero.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.580
Why don’t you join
forces with us once more?

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.250
<i>I’ll think about it when
the time comes.</i>

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.340
<i>See ya!</i>

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:56.960
<i>We don’t want to be late
for the party!</i>

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.010
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:01.000
<i>Don’t blame us if they
run out of food.</i>

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.070
They haven’t changed.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.760
Sally, we’ll have to contain the
Tauruses ourselves.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.970
Let’s divert their attention
to us.

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.140
Okay!

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:11.850
So we’re backing them up,
after all.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.660
But right now, we’ve gotta
depend on them.

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:15.770
Yes.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.180
That’s what’s so reassuring!

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.740
How’s this for some
shuttle maneuvering?!

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:30.000
I was counting on those skills
right from the beginning.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.860
That’s good to hear!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.590
Hold on tight!

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:23.010
We’re going in!

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.520
Outta my way!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.550
I’m grateful to have you
guys accompany me, Rashid.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.310
Don’t mention it, Master Quatre.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:07.240
It’s all my fault to begin with.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:10.430
If I hadn’t mentioned sending
the Gundams into the sun…

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.140
…this wouldn’t have happened.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:15.100
No one could have predicted
this would happen.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:18.690
Let’s just concentrate on
the immediate problem.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.860
Yes, you’re right.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.780
Do you think we can still
catch up…

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.650
…to the Gundam disposal block?

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:30.120
The block is over fifty days
away from Venus’ orbit.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:32.120
With this Interplanetary
Transport Ship…

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.330
…we should barely
catch up to it.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:37.120
Don’t worry, everything
will work out fine.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.790
We wouldn’t want to return
to find the Earth gone.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.670
It all depends on us.

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:47.300
We must retrieve
the Gundams at all costs.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:09.160
I’m surprised they kept this
many mobile suits intact!

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:25.540
Staying here will only work
to our disadvantage!

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.840
<i>Destroy all you can,
then escape.</i>

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:30.340
<i>Proceed at your own discretion.</i>

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:31.470
Roger!

00:22:37.030 --> 00:22:39.220
It’s a new model!

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:47.690
He’s pretty good.

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:51.240
Hey, I know this…

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:53.650
I know this style of combat!

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:01.540
No question!

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.290
Trowa’s in that suit!

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:04.790
Damn it!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:32.310
I’ve always wanted
to fight you like this!

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:41.790
What’s going on, Wufei?!

00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:43.630
Are you guys doing
the right thing?

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:44.630
What?!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.680
I’m asking if you guys
are doing the right thing!?

00:24:01.980 --> 00:25:35.990
<i>m -200 -200 l 1640 -200 1640 160 -200 160</i>

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:05.810
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:09.070
<i>mitsumekaesu hitomi ni</i>

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:09.070
<i>The reflection of your eyes
looking at me</i>

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:12.110
<i>egaite haruka na</i>

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:12.110
<i>Is etched in my mind
as an everlasting</i>

00:24:12.110 --> 00:24:18.900
<i>Never-ending story</i>

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:35.720
<i>kanashimi mo itami mo</i>

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:35.720
<i>Beating these wings
with all my might</i>

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:38.890
<i>furikiru you ni habataku</i>

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:38.890
<i>To shake off all sadness,
shake off all pain</i>

00:24:38.890 --> 00:24:41.770
<i>anata ga kureta tsubasa wo</i>

00:24:38.890 --> 00:24:41.770
<i>These wings will always
be spread across my heart</i>

00:24:41.770 --> 00:24:45.560
<i>kono mune ni hirogete</i>

00:24:41.770 --> 00:24:45.560
<i>These wings that I received
from you</i>

00:24:45.560 --> 00:24:51.940
<i>aa kakegaenai ai no kodou wo</i>

00:24:45.560 --> 00:24:51.940
<i>As painful as it may be
and as upset as I may get</i>

00:24:51.940 --> 00:24:58.700
<i>setsunaku kuruoshiku kanjite itai</i>

00:24:51.940 --> 00:24:58.700
<i>I hope to keep feeling
this precious love beating</i>

00:24:58.700 --> 00:25:02.010
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:25:02.010 --> 00:25:05.410
<i>atsuku yume wo kasanete</i>

00:25:02.010 --> 00:25:05.410
<i>We’ll have many passionate
dreams together</i>

00:25:05.410 --> 00:25:08.710
<i>ayamachi osorezu ni</i>

00:25:05.410 --> 00:25:08.710
<i>Unafraid to make mistakes</i>

00:25:08.710 --> 00:25:11.980
<i>motomeau seishun</i>

00:25:08.710 --> 00:25:11.960
<i>We’ll look to each other</i>

00:25:11.980 --> 00:25:15.260
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:25:15.260 --> 00:25:18.430
<i>mitsumekaesu hitomi ni</i>

00:25:15.260 --> 00:25:18.430
<i>The reflection of your eyes
looking at me</i>

00:25:18.430 --> 00:25:21.600
<i>egaite haruka na</i>

00:25:18.430 --> 00:25:21.600
<i>Is etched in my mind
as an everlasting</i>

00:25:21.600 --> 00:25:28.620
<i>Never-ending story</i>

00:25:39.740 --> 00:25:42.200
Next Episode

00:25:42.200 --> 00:25:44.650
The war for independence
started by the colony…

00:25:44.650 --> 00:25:46.820
…was merely a prelude.

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:50.080
Burdened with their unshakeable
pasts…

00:25:50.080 --> 00:25:52.840
…the young men continue
to battle against fate…

00:25:52.840 --> 00:25:55.760
…while the young girl
seeking a victor…

00:25:55.760 --> 00:25:57.840
…sends a shooting star
toward Earth.

00:25:57.840 --> 00:26:02.100
Tragedy is delivered,
as history is repeated.

00:26:02.740 --> 00:26:06.820
Next, on <i>Gundam Wing:
Endless Waltz</i>, episode 2.

